  "description": "On March 11, ATRenew ( ) reported earnings.",
  "body_html": "<p>On March 11, ATRenew ( <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$RERE&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> ) reported earnings. Results were better than expected, with revenue climbing ~25% y/y for the quarter and full-year. Profitability also advanced reflecting operating margin improvements as the company expanded its 1P direct sales to consumers and multi-category recycling businesses. During the call, management highlighted strong momentum from partnerships with JD.com and rising brand awareness via new media channels.</p><p>I expect RERE to continue benefiting from ongoing consumer upgrade trends, stronger trade-in demand, and further development of high-margin product categories. As a result, I believe revenue will continue growing. Having said that, I am closing our position looking at a 20% gain or 52% IRR.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pswC!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F64c34e4e-c35e-4a1e-b845-39af38f13142_524x65.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pswC!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F64c34e4e-c35e-4a1e-b845-39af38f13142_524x65.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pswC!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F64c34e4e-c35e-4a1e-b845-39af38f13142_524x65.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pswC!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F64c34e4e-c35e-4a1e-b845-39af38f13142_524x65.png 1456w\" sizes=\"10